ze:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">All bank accounts mapped with your\r\nUPI ID are listed in this section. Click on individual accounts provides you\r\noption to perform many tasks:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Check balance :</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;Bank balance is displayed to user by entering\r\nMPIN set for the selected bank account. On correct MPIN entered balance amount\r\nfrom account is fetched and is displayed to user. Please go to contextual menu\r\n-&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account -&gt; Request for balance<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Check Bank Details\r\n:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;User\r\ncan check details of the bank account in this section like Bank IFSC, Type of\r\naccount, Bank Name &amp; Masked Account Number. Status of MPIN set and option\r\nto set the account as Default is given (If account is not set as default\r\nalready)<br>\r\nPlease go to contextual menu -&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Set/Reset MPIN :</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;On clicking option to\r\nSet/Reset MPIN, user can reset or set new MPIN against the bank account. MPIN\r\nis used for all bank related transactions. User needs to enter last 6 digits of\r\nDebit Card of the bank account, Expiry Date. User gets option to change MPIN by\r\nentering OTP which is received on bank registered mobile number and New MPIN.\r\nPlease go to contextual menu -&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account -&gt; Set/Reset MPIN<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Change MPIN :</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;On clicking option to\r\nChange MPIN, user can change existing MPIN set against the bank account. MPIN\r\nis used for all bank related transactions. User needs to enter last 6 digits of\r\nDebit Card of the bank account, Expiry Date. User gets option to change MPIN by\r\nentering Existing MOIN, OTP which is received in SMS on bank registered mobile\r\nnumber and New MPIN.<br>\r\nPlease go to contextual menu -&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account -&gt; Change MPIN<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">e.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Set Account as\r\nDefault :</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;In\r\ncase of multiple bank accounts mapped, any one account can be set as default.\r\nDefault account is used by default for Payment or receiving amount from UPI ID.\r\nPlease go to contextual menu -&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account -&gt; Change Set\r\nAccount as Default<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">f.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Unlink Bank Account\r\n:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">&nbsp;User\r\ncan unlick any bank account mapped with UPI ID. Once unlinked, user will not be\r\nable to make further transactions using this bank on Pokkuvandi UPI ID. It does\r\nnot affect the bank account or make any changes to other UPI IDs, if same\r\naccount is mapped. Please go to contextual menu -&gt; UPI -&gt; Bank Account\r\n-&gt; Unlink<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";color:#ff6c00;=\"\" mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">How do I register with BHIM UPI</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Pokkuvandi gives option to register\r\non BHIM UPI. User can install Pokkuvandi app on Android/iOS devices.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User\r\nregisters and logs in the app.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">b.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User gets option to Register UPI\r\nin sidebar.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">c.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">SMS is sent from users device for\r\nvalidating the number at Bank.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">d.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User gets list of UPI Enabled\r\nBanks.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">e.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User selects bank where bank\r\naccount(s) are associated with the logged in mobile number of the device.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">f.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User selected an account and\r\nconfirm on registration.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.75pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">g.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Users UPI ID is created with Pokkuvandi\r\nhandle<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">User can share this UPI ID with\r\nanyone for receiving requests for payments. Please go to contextual menu -&gt;\r\nUPI -&gt; Register UPI<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-in\"=\"\">Terms for Reseller / Service Provider</span></b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">This document is an electronic record\r\nin terms of the Information Technology Act, 2000 and rules there under as\r\napplicable and the amended provisions pertaining to electronic records in\r\nvarious statutes as amended by the Information Technology Act, 2000. This\r\nelectronic record is generated by a computer system and does not require any\r\nphysical or digital signatures. This document is published in accordance with\r\nthe provisions of Rule 3 (1) of the Information Technology (Intermediaries\r\nGuidelines) Rules, 2011 that require publishing the Terms for access or usage\r\nof Pokkuvandis service via Pokkuvandis Portal. This document meets the\r\nstipulations and conditions mentioned in Section 65B (2) of the Indian Evidence\r\nAct, 1872.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">This Reseller/Service Provier Terms\r\n(\"Contract\") is entered between Pokkuvandi Limited, a Company located\r\nat Erode (Tamilnadu), India (\"Pokkuvandi\") and You, (hereinafter\r\nreferred to as \"You\" or \"Reseller\" or “Service Provider”).\r\nYou confirm that by providing the Reseller/Service Provider Services you\r\nindicate your acceptance of all terms and conditions of this Contract that are\r\nbinding, the terms has been clearly read, understood and accepted by you. We\r\nreserves the right, at its sole discretion, to change, modify, add or remove\r\nportions of these Terms, at any time without any prior written notice to you.\r\nIts your responsibility to review these Terms periodically for updates/\r\nchanges. Your continuation of services following the posting of changes will\r\nmean that they have accepted and agreed to the revisions.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#606060;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">1. DEFINITIONS:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";color:#424242;mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";=\"\" color:#4242