o-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">When\r\nusing vendors to collect personal information on the behalf of Pokkuvandi, it\r\nshall ensure that the vendors comply with the data protection requirements of Pokkuvandi\r\nas defined in this Policy.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:11.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">J.\r\nRetention of Your Information:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl7 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">The\r\nPersonal information may only be used for the purposes identified in the TOS\r\nand only if you have given consent. Personal information shall be retained for\r\nas long as necessary for business purposes identified in the TOS at the time of\r\ncollection or subsequently authorized by you. We retain your personal\r\ninformation in accordance with applicable laws, for a period no longer than is\r\nrequired for the purpose for which it was collected or as required under any\r\napplicable law. However, we may retain data related to you if we believe it may\r\nbe necessary to prevent fraud or future abuse or if required by law or for\r\nother legitimate purposes. We may continue to retain your data in anonymised\r\nform for analytical and research purposes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl7 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">When the\r\nuse of personal information is no longer necessary for business purposes, a\r\nmethod shall be in place to ensure that the information is destroyed in a\r\nmanner sufficient to prevent unauthorized access to that information or is\r\nde-identified in a manner sufficient to make the data non-personally\r\nidentifiable. Pokkuvandi shall have a documented process to communicate changes\r\nin retention periods of personal information required by the business to you\r\nwho are authorized to request those changes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl7 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Pokkuvandi\r\nholding sensitive personal data or information shall not retain that information\r\nfor longer than is required for the purposes for which the information may\r\nlawfully be used or is otherwise required under any other law for the time\r\nbeing in force. Pokkuvandi has framed the data retention policy and it retains\r\nall sorts of data/information including sensitive personal data or information\r\nin accordance with data retention policy. The data/information shall be\r\nde-identified/destroyed, when the purposes of data collection can be achieved,\r\nin accordance with our data retention policy.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl7 level1 lfo16;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Personal\r\ninformation shall be erased if their storage violates any of the data\r\nprotection law or if knowledge of the data is no longer required by Pokkuvandi\r\nor for the benefit of the data providers. Additionally, Pokkuvandi has the\r\nright to retain the personnel information for legal and regulatory purpose as\r\nper applicable laws. Pokkuvandi shall perform an internal audit on an annual\r\nbasis to ensure that personal information collected is used, retained and\r\ndisposed-off in compliance with the applicable law.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:11.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">K. Review\r\nof Information by You:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl6 level1 lfo17;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Pokkuvandi shall establish &amp;\r\nfacilitates a mechanism to enable you to review the data/information you had\r\nprovided, as per your choice, and shall access, edit, rectify, modify, delete\r\nany personal information or sensitive personal information found to be\r\ninaccurate or deficient. However Pokkuvandi shall not be responsible for the\r\nauthenticity of the personal information or sensitive personal information\r\nsupplied by you.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl6 level1 lfo17;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">You shall be entitled to obtain\r\nthe details about your personal information upon a request made and set forth\r\nin writing. Pokkuvandi shall provide its response within 72 (seventy two) hours\r\nof receipt of written request. You shall have the right to require Pokkuvandi\r\nto correct or supplement erroneous, misleading, outdated, or incomplete\r\npersonal information. We shall record &amp; document each access request as it\r\nis received and the corresponding action taken. Pokkuvandi shall provide\r\npersonal information to you in a plain simple format which is understandable.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:11.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">L. Your\r\nConsent (Opt-in &amp; Opt-out):<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">By\r\nvisiting our Platform or by providing your information, you consent to the\r\ncollection, use, storage, disclosure and otherwise processing of your\r\ninformation (including sensitive personal information) on our Platform in\r\naccordance with this Privacy Policy. If you disclose to us any personal\r\ninformation relating to other people, you represent that you have the authority\r\nto do so and to permit us to use the information in accordance with this\r\nPrivacy Policy. You, while providing your personal information over our\r\nPlatform or any of our partner Platform or establishments, consent to us\r\n(including our affiliates, lending partners, technology partners, marketing\r\nchannels, business partners, vendors, service providers and other third\r\nparties) to contact you through SMS, instant messaging apps, call and/or e-mail\r\nfor the purposes specified in this Privacy Policy.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">If you\r\nwant to manage, change, or edit your information, we allow you to do so through\r\nthe Settings tools: You can change your settings to manage certain information\r\navailable to other users. You can manage your contacts, groups, and broadcast\r\nlists, or use our block feature to manage the users with whom you communicate.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">If you\r\nare vendors, you can add or update certain information in vendor-s module,\r\nupdate your account information by accessing your vendors Account Information,\r\nand adjust your e-mail or other communications you receive from us by updating\r\nyour Notification Preferences.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">You can\r\nadd or update your Personal Information on regular basis. Pokkuvandi would\r\nretain your previous Personal Information in its records.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">You may,\r\nof course, decline to submit Personally Identifiable Information through the Pokkuvandi\r\nService, in which case Pokkuvandi may not be able to provide certain services\r\nto you. If you do not agree with our Privacy Policy or Terms of Service, please\r\ndelete your account and uninstall the Pokkuvandi mobile application; your\r\ncontinued usage of the Pokkuvandi Service will signify your assent to and\r\nacceptance of our Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. To protect your privacy\r\nand security, we take reasonable steps (such as SMS authentication in certain\r\ncases) to verify your identity before registering your mobile phone number and\r\ngranting you access to the Pokkuvandi Service. Please contact Pokkuvandi via\r\nemail to privacy at Pokkuvandi.com or available web forms with any questions or\r\ncomments about this Privacy Policy, your personal information, your consent, or\r\nyour opt-in or opt-out choices.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Pokkuvandi\r\nshall, prior to the collection of information including sensitive personal data\r\nor information, provide an option to you to not to provide the data or\r\ninformation sought to be collected. Pokkuvandi shall establish systems for the\r\ncollection and documentation of Your consent to the collection, processing,\r\nand/or transfer of personal data. You shall be informed about the choices\r\navailable to them with respect to the collection, use, and disclosure of\r\npersonal information.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Further, Pokkuvandi\r\nshall establish &amp; facilitates a mechanism to enable You to, at any time\r\nwhile availing the services or otherwise, to withdraw its consent given earlier\r\nto Pokkuvandi. If You not providing the consent or later on withdrawing your\r\nconsent, Pokkuvandi reserves its right not to provide goods/services for which\r\nthe said information was sought. Consent shall be obtained (in\r\nwriting/electronically) from You before or at the time of collecting personal\r\ninformation or as soon as practical thereafter.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo18;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">The\r\nchanges to your preferences shall be managed and documented. Consent or\r\nwithdrawal of consent shall be documented appropriately. The choices shall be\r\nimplemented in a timely fashion and respected. If personal information is to be\r\nused for purposes not identified in the TOS at the time of collection, the new\r\npurpose shall be documented, You shall be notified, and consent shall be\r\nobtained prior to such new use or purpose. You shall be notified if the data\r\ncollected is used for marketing purposes, advertisements, etc.,. Pokkuvandi\r\nshall review the policies of the Third Parties and types of consent of Third\r\nParties before accepting personal information from Third-Party data sources.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:11.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">M. Consent\r\nto Push Notification:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\nl17 level1 lfo19;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-IN\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">You agree\r\nand confirm that any review, rating and comments, including any other content\r\nor data therein, that you submit/post on Pokkuvandi platforms viz. WEB, WAP,\r\nAPP &amp; Phone etc. such details as per Pokkuvandi-s discretion will be shared\r\nwith your Tagged Friends who are the users of Pokkuvandi-s services.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:11.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"