\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">physical, physiological and\r\n  mental health condition;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">sexual orientation;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">medical records and history;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">Biometric information;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">any detail relating to the\r\n  above clauses as provided to body corporate for<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">8.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">providing service; and<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.25pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n  5.25pt;margin-left:18.75pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:\r\n  l24 level1 lfo27;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">9.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\";mso-fareast-language:en-in\"=\"\">any of the information received\r\n  under above clauses by bo